248,Digital Logic Design,Digital Logic Design,Laws of Boolean Algebra — Basic identities [3d64d50f],"Identity, null, idempotent, and complement laws | Law | AND form | OR form | Identity | A · 1 = A | A + 0 = A | Null / Dominance | A · 0 = 0 | A + 1 = 1 | Idempotent | A · A = A | A + A = A | Complement | A · A′ = 0 | A + A′ = 1",digital-logic-design;laws-of-boolean-algebra;lesson_passage,https://munsakad.github.io/Hardware-Engineering-Education-Hub/pages/course.html?slug=digital-logic-design&lesson=laws-of-boolean-algebra,lesson:digital-logic-design/laws-of-boolean-algebra,lesson_passage
